        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Escape the daily routine and dive into a soothing hidden object adventure! Explore breathtaking outdoor locations—from serene hiking trails and peaceful lakes to scenic horseback rides and cozy cabins. Test your observation skills as you search for hidden objects, solve captivating puzzles, and collect unique souvenirs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.poster.avif?t=1772657571\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.webm?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.mp4?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Three Hidden Object Modes</strong> – Find items in different search styles to earn stars and unlock new areas.<br>✔ <strong>Challenging Mini-Games &amp; Puzzles</strong> – Enjoy a variety of fun brain teasers.<br>✔ <strong>Collectible Souvenirs</strong> – Gather special keepsakes from your journey.<br>✔ <strong>Relaxing Bonus Content</strong> – Unlock wallpapers, a music player, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/e885a46b56c5ad23c99eb2e8394244f1.poster.avif?t=1772657571\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/e885a46b56c5ad23c99eb2e8394244f1.webm?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/e885a46b56c5ad23c99eb2e8394244f1.mp4?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➕ 12 additional hidden object levels<br>➕ 8 bonus mini-games from the previous game<br>➕ A special souvenir shop to complete your collection<br>➕ Extra puzzles and surprises for pet lovers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break, unwind, and immerse yourself in nature with <i>Amazing Weekend: Search and Relax 3</i>—the perfect hidden object escape! </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Escape the daily routine and dive into a soothing hidden object adventure! Explore breathtaking outdoor locations—from serene hiking trails and peaceful lakes to scenic horseback rides and cozy cabins. Test your observation skills as you search for hidden objects, solve captivating puzzles, and collect unique souvenirs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.poster.avif?t=1772657571\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.webm?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/5df0fcf453c6d4e68f57536bbb69ae6c.mp4?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ <strong>Three Hidden Object Modes</strong> – Find items in different search styles to earn stars and unlock new areas.<br>✔ <strong>Challenging Mini-Games &amp; Puzzles</strong> – Enjoy a variety of fun brain teasers.<br>✔ <strong>Collectible Souvenirs</strong> – Gather special keepsakes from your journey.<br>✔ <strong>Relaxing Bonus Content</strong> – Unlock wallpapers, a music player, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/e885a46b56c5ad23c99eb2e8394244f1.poster.avif?t=1772657571\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478690/extras/e885a46b56c5ad23c99eb2e8394244f1.webm?t=1772657571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=